*'''Central''', also known as the '''Zhizhiluo-Laomudeng''' (知之罗-老姆登) dialect: southern [[Fugong County]] 福贡县, in Pihe 匹河怒族乡,<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://www.ynszxc.net/model/index4.aspx?departmentid=1524 |title=福贡县匹河怒族乡新农村建设信息网 |access-date=2018-12-30 |archive-date=2018-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181230194950/http://www.ynszxc.net/model/index4.aspx?departmentid=1524 |url-status=dead }}</ref> Zhizhiluo 知之罗,<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147913 | title=福贡县匹河怒族乡知子罗村委会 | access-date=2018-12-30 | archive-date=2020-08-05 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200805220948/http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147913 | url-status=dead }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147914 | title=福贡县匹河怒族乡知子罗村委会知子罗 达罗 | access-date=2018-12-30 | archive-date=2020-08-05 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200805201751/http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147914 | url-status=dead }}</ref> Laomudeng 老姆登,<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147916 | title=福贡县匹河怒族乡老姆登村委会 | access-date=2018-12-30 | archive-date=2020-08-05 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200805221128/http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147916 | url-status=dead }}</ref> Miangu 棉古,<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147934 | title=福贡县匹河怒族乡棉谷村委会 | access-date=2018-12-30 | archive-date=2020-08-05 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200805194218/http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147934 | url-status=dead }}</ref> Shawa 沙瓦,<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=147925 | title=福贡县匹河怒族乡沙瓦村委会沙瓦 | access-date=2018-12-30 | archive-date=2020-08-05 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200805194236/http://www.ynszxc.net/villagePage/vIndex.aspx?departmentid=14792