The divergent '''Liangsu dialect''' (良苏话) is spoken in by about 3,000 people in the following locations of [[Fugong County]], Yunnan.<ref>Chen, Haihong [陈海宏]; Tan, Liya [谭丽亚]. 2022. ''Yunnan binwei Nuyu Liangsuhua ynajiu'' [云南濒危怒语良苏话研究]. Beijing: Minzu chubanshe [民族出版社].</ref><ref>Ye, Shifu [叶世富]. 2007. ''Jianu Liangsu Nuyu'' [甲怒良苏怒语]. Unpublished manuscript.</ref>

*Zilijia Township 子里甲乡: Jianu 甲怒, Mazudi 马祖底, Jiada 甲打, Lamujia 腊母甲, Jiache 加车
*Jiakedi Township 架科底乡: Jiake 架科, La'anjia 腊安甲

